nvidia-kmod-open (615.71.09-2+stereo3d6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 0012: dmem_cgroup_register_region() takes a struct dmem_cgroup_init on
    Linux 7.3 (commit e11640b9cea4). NVIDIA's own change from 615.78.08,
    taken as it is: the conftest
    dmem_cgroup_register_region_has_init_arg and the call that builds the
    structure. With CONFIG_CGROUP_DMEM=y, which the edition's kernel turns
    on from build 13 for the VRAM protection Linux 7.3 merged, 615.71.09
    did not compile (os-interface.c, argument 1 of
    dmem_cgroup_register_region). Older kernels keep the old call.

